MTF Unit:  Iota-27 (“Art Connoisseurs”)

MTF Squad:  Delta-3

SCP-5487-1:  Starry Night by Van Gogh

Task:  Reach the edge of SCP-5487-1

Foreword:  Communication with individuals within SCP-5487-1 has proven impossible. The following was locally stored on the person of Lt. Johnson.

 

(Lt. Johnson, Pvt. Carter, and Pvt. Miller are audibly laughing. Sgt. Anderson is not amused.)

Sgt. Anderson:  Sorry to interrupt, but something stands out about that cabin over there. It looks different than all of the other buildings we have seen before.

(While being colored like the others, the indicated structure seems to be built with actual geometry.)

Lt. Johnson:  Well then, let’s go take a look.

(The group moves closer to the structure. Upon closer inspection, it is clear it is built differently than the others.)

Lt. Johnson:  Private Miller, can you go knock on the door?**

Pvt. Miller:  Yes Lieutenant.

(Miller walks up and knocks on the front door.)

Unknown:  Hello?

(A human male opens the front door. The physical appearance of the individual does not appear to have been painted.)

Unknown:  Who are you? It’s not often that I get visitors.**

Pvt. Miller:  How did you get in this place?

Unknown:  What do you mean?

Pvt. Miller:  Are there any others like you?

Unknown:  You sure are asking a lot of questions. Do you want to come inside?

Pvt. Miller:  Why not?

(Pvt. Miller enters the structure. Inside is a sitting area.)

Unknown:  Coffee?

Pvt. Miller:  No thanks.

Unknown:  Shame. I make it myself. Alright. Now that I’m comfortable, I get it you have some questions for me?

Pvt. Miller:  That is correct.

Unknown:  Spit it out then.

Pvt. Miller:  Are there other people here?

Unknown:  You would be the first in a few years. But yes, there are other people in this ‘realm’.

Pvt. Miller.  And how did you get here?**

Unknown:  I don’t know.

Pvt. Miller:  Do you have a name?

Unknown:  Jack.

Pvt. Miller:  So, Jack, where were you before you got here?

Unknown:  Chicago.

Pvt. Miller:  Do you know where the other people here came from?

Unknown:  I never asked them, that seemed a bit personal.

Pvt. Miller:  Do you know where they are now?

Unknown:  Most likely ok this realm, I don’t know where they are exactly though.

Pvt. Miller:  I see. Well, I think I have to get going. We will meet again, Jack.

 

End Note:  Following this, the subject was designated as SCP-5487-2. See Addendum-XXXX-A





